{
	"gameType": "bookOf",
	"about": "Book-of games (expanding special in free spins, buy feature), dealt by the book mock (`scripts/mock-rgs-server-book.mjs`), with the pots overlay where the game has one. 15 screens, 17 with the pots overlay.",
